 For `t` negative offset cycles, the normalized witness is unique in the declared language at the shipping parameters. Before switching, its eigenvalue is `lambda=n-1-4t`. Every other eigenvalue in the antisymmetric lift subspace has absolute value at most `1+4t`; `n>8t+2` gives the spectral gap used by the reference attack.
 
