Implemented a self-contained Track B generator based on the paper’s Section 5.2 spectral community-detection objects.

- [Generator module](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1409.2290/gen_1409_2290.py)
- [Self-test report](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1409.2290/selftest_report.json)
