Local verification is now complete in substance: the revised generator passes all nine local gates, including exact planted checks, five distinct corruption failures, 0/200,000 structure-aware guesses, 0/8 for all four cheap attacks, and 8/8 for the disclosed cubic reference algorithm. I’m doing the final reproducibility/profile checks and regenerating the machine-readable report.
