codex
Completed and externally hardened.

The module builds exact cyclic two-lift community instances inspired by Sections 5.1–5.2 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/1409.2290). It uses Track B because modular Gaussian elimination solves the problem in polynomial time.

Key results:

- Shipping preset: `n=251`
- Bare oracle: 0/3 solved
- Structural hint: 0/3 solved
- Placebo hint: 0/3 solved
- Random guesses: 0/200,000
- Four adversarial heuristics: 0/8 each
- Reference algorithm: 15,917,420 modular operations, 8/8 solved
- Answer: 503 characters, 251 atoms
- Compact route: 250 XOR/XNOR operations
- All local gates pass

Deliverables:

- [gen_1409_2290.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1409.2290/gen_1409_2290.py:1)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1409.2290/selftest_report.json)
